## 2. Project Objective

Build a modern, responsive, React-based web application called **Dynamic JSON Editor**.

The purpose of this application is to allow users to upload a JSON file, automatically generate an editable form based on its structure, update existing values, add new fields or nested objects, manage arrays, and download the updated JSON file.

The application must work with different JSON structures without hardcoding field names or assuming a fixed schema.

**Core workflow:**

Upload JSON → Parse JSON → Generate Dynamic Form → Edit Values → Add or Remove Fields → Save Changes → Download Updated JSON.

